<title>USA: Irving, Texas $9.3 mln won by Dean Witter.</title>
<headline>Irving, Texas $9.3 mln won by Dean Witter.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-02-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Dean Witter said it won $9.3 million of Irving, Texas, waterworks and sewer system revenue improvement and refunding bonds, Series 1997, with a net interest cost of 5.38 percent.</p>
